                        "name": "VS Agent - Verana Business Wallet",
                        "description": "VS Agent is the reference implementation of a Verifiable Service: an open-source, self-hosted business wallet that gives every service an organization operates a verifiable identity, so anyone can check what it is and who runs it before connecting.\n\nIts DID plugs into the Verana Network, a public decentralized trust infrastructure that no vendor or state controls: join any ecosystem as issuer, verifier or holder, with no platform account and no gatekeeper. Each ecosystem defines its own onboarding process (registry lookup, accreditation, eIDAS-grade KYB if required) and its own privacy-preserving business model: onboarding, pay-per-issuance and pay-per-verification fees settled on-chain, without tracking users. The credential lifecycle is automatic via the vt-flow protocol: onboarding triggers issuance, on-chain revocation reaches the holder.\n\nDIDComm and OpenID4VCI/VP; JSON-LD, AnonCreds and SD-JWT VC. Host chat agents, MCP servers, A2A agents or HTTP APIs under one DID. Apache-2.0.",
